{{.OutputSchema}}

EXTRACTION RULES:
- No Assumptions: Only extract facts explicitly stated. NEVER guess.
- Omit Unknowns in facts: Se um fato não foi mencionado, NÃO O INCLUA no JSON.
- Merge & Refine: If a new value is more specific (e.g., "Apartamento" vs "Imóvel"), update it.
- Handle Contradictions: If the user changes their mind, update the fact. To explicitly remove an invalidated fact, set its value to null.
- Consistent Keys: Only use the exact fact keys defined in the schema:
